    {
      "source": "Replacing <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-404bc468\"></svg> </span> with <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-44e40ee2\"></svg> </span> gives the following:",
      "translation": "将 `<span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-404bc468\"></svg> </span>` 替换为 `<span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-44e40ee2\"></svg> </span>` 后，结果如下：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The head of the vector <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-5715f0c1\"></svg> </span> is at the point <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-8f7fc181\"></svg> </span>.\nThe <strong>x</strong> coordinate value is <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-b2125f65\"></svg> </span> and the <strong>y</strong> coordinate value is <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-e9683872\"></svg> </span>. The coordinates are also referred to as the components of the vector.",
      "translation": "向量<span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-5715f0c1\"></svg> </span>的起点位于点<span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-8f7fc181\"></svg> </span>。其<strong>x</strong>坐标值为<span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-b2125f65\"></svg> </span>，<strong>y</strong>坐标值为<span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-e9683872\"></svg> </span>。这些坐标也称为向量的分量。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The vectors <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-ec1dc1e5\"></svg> </span> and <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-0cbbc676\"></svg> </span> are considered similar, when they are pointing close to each other, as in the first diagram.\nThe vectors are considered unrelated when pointing perpendicular to each other and opposite when they point away from each other.",
      "translation": "当向量 <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-ec1dc1e5\"></svg> </span> 和 <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-0cbbc676\"></svg> </span> 指向彼此附近时（如第一个图示所示），它们被视为相似。当向量相互垂直时，它们被视为无关；当它们彼此背离时，则被视为相反。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The dot product between two vectors <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-ec1dc1e5\"></svg> </span> and <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-0cbbc676\"></svg> </span> is defined in terms of its components as:",
      "translation": "两个向量 <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-ec1dc1e5\"></svg> </span> 和 <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-0cbbc676\"></svg> </span> 的点积定义为其分量的形式为：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The angle between them, <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-90600245\"></svg> </span>, is a good measure of their similarity.\nHow can the angle <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-90600245\"></svg> </span> be computed?",
      "translation": "它们之间的夹角<span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-90600245\"></svg> </span>是衡量其相似性的良好指标。\n如何计算该夹角<span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-90600245\"></svg> </span>？",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Vectors have dimensionality and a direction.\nFor example, the following image depicts a two-dimensional vector <span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-5715f0c1\"></svg> </span> in the cartesian coordinate system pictured as an arrow.",
      "translation": "向量具有维度和方向。例如，下图展示了一个二维向量<span class=\"steminline\"> <svg id=\"svg-stash-5715f0c1\"></svg> </span>，在笛卡尔坐标系中以箭头的形式呈现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
