    {
      "source": "What about when the angle between <strong>a</strong> and <strong>b</strong> is not 90 degrees?",
      "translation": "那当<strong>a</strong>与<strong>b</strong>之间的夹角不是 90 度时呢？",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following image shows this approach as a vector diagram:\n<span class=\"image\"><img alt=\"lawofcosines\" src=\"../../_images/lawofcosines.png\" width=\"200\"/></span>",
      "translation": "下图以矢量图的形式展示了该方法：\n<span class=\"image\"><img alt=\"lawofcosines\" src=\"../../_images/lawofcosines.png\" width=\"200\"/></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"https://towardsdatascience.com/cosine-similarity-how-does-it-measure-the-similarity-maths-behind-and-usage-in-python-50ad30aad7db\">Expanding this out</a> gives us the formula for <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cosine_similarity\">Cosine Similarity</a>.",
      "translation": "将上述内容展开，我们便得到了<a href=\"https://towardsdatascience.com/cosine-similarity-how-does-it-measure-the-similarity-maths-behind-and-usage-in-python-50ad30aad7db\">余弦相似度</a>的公式：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cosine_similarity\">Cosine Similarity</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The similarity function in higher dimensions using the components of the vector is shown below.\nIt expands the two-dimensional definitions of Magnitude and Dot Product given previously to <strong>N</strong> dimensions by using <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Summation\">Summation mathematical syntax</a>.",
      "translation": "以下是使用向量分量表示的高维空间中相似性函数。\n它利用<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Summation\">求和数学符号</a>，将之前给出的二维定义中的幅值和点积扩展到了<strong>N</strong>维空间。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "We are all familiar with the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pythagorean_theorem#History\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>.",
      "translation": "我们大家都熟悉<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pythagorean_theorem#History\">勾股定理</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Enter the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Law_of_cosines\">Law of cosines</a>.",
      "translation": "输入<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Law_of_cosines\">余弦定理</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This formula works for dimensions higher than 2 or 3, though it is hard to visualize. However, <a href=\"https://projector.tensorflow.org/\">it can be visualized to some extent</a>.\nIt is common for vectors in AI/ML applications to have hundreds or even thousands of dimensions.",
      "translation": "该公式适用于高于 2 或 3 维的情况，尽管难以直观想象。不过，<a href=\"https://projector.tensorflow.org/\">可以在一定程度上进行可视化</a>。在人工智能/机器学习应用中，向量通常具有数百甚至数千个维度。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This is the key formula used in the simple implementation of a vector store and can be found in the <code>SimpleVectorStore</code> implementation - applicable for testing and demonstration purposes only.",
      "translation": "这是简单向量存储实现中使用的关键公式，可在<code>SimpleVectorStore</code>实现中找到——仅适用于测试和演示目的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
